    "name": "War of Wheels",
    "steam_appid": 2337940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/66daa0af4f3070b3bf2da6a5f7db0e44.avif?t=1754478225\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MEDIEVAL JOURNEY WITH A V8 ROAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your iron steed across vast battlefields and deadly arenas filled with traps and obstacles. Choose your class, build your war machine, and prove your mastery on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich medieval-punk world where fantasy meets roaring engines and the arcane magic of the Aether.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METAL ON METAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In War of Wheels, the carnage unfolds in two thrilling modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiatorial Arena</strong>: Enter a colosseum filled with traps and engage in fearsome one-on-one duels, where unpredictable magic and environmental hazards make every encounter unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Battle</strong>: Roam the world, ambush enemy factions, and take part in epic team skirmishes. Available during early access.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE WAR MACHINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five powerful car classes (Knight, Ranger, Assassin, Barbarian, and an exclusive early access class, the Artificer) and equip your vehicle with unique weapons and abilities. Unlock armor plates, spiked bumpers, and ether-infused upgrades to create a deadly and stylish combat vehicle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy classes: 5 distinct car classes that blend RPG archetypes with car combat, each with custom weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast continent: battle across 4 unique environments, from fortified cities to frozen tundras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited customization: endless combinations of skins, decals, weapons, and gadgets to perfect your steel steed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible arenas: Wreak havoc in dynamic colosseums filled with traps and destructible scenery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions and politics: Align yourself with one of 4 powerful guilds, each with their own goals and storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared screen: Play with a friend and battle each other in arenas.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MEDIEVAL JOURNEY WITH A V8 ROAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/09e17292aafdb7a366d2a9ba25922155.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride your iron steed across vast battlefields and deadly arenas filled with traps and obstacles. Choose your class, build your war machine, and prove your mastery on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich medieval-punk world where fantasy meets roaring engines and the arcane magic of the Aether.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METAL ON METAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/a5f6c8e620ff3c16a84188a54b6b55dc.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In War of Wheels, the carnage unfolds in two thrilling modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiatorial Arena</strong>: Enter a colosseum filled with traps and engage in fearsome one-on-one duels, where unpredictable magic and environmental hazards make every encounter unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Battle</strong>: Roam the world, ambush enemy factions, and take part in epic team skirmishes. Available during early access.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULLY CUSTOMIZABLE WAR MACHINES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.poster.avif?t=1754478225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.webm?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337940/extras/22e751d8927a71a808f15274c544963b.mp4?t=1754478225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from five powerful car classes (Knight, Ranger, Assassin, Barbarian, and an exclusive early access class, the Artificer) and equip your vehicle with unique weapons and abilities. Unlock armor plates, spiked bumpers, and ether-infused upgrades to create a deadly and stylish combat vehicle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy classes: 5 distinct car classes that blend RPG archetypes with car combat, each with custom weapons and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast continent: battle across 4 unique environments, from fortified cities to frozen tundras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited customization: endless combinations of skins, decals, weapons, and gadgets to perfect your steel steed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible arenas: Wreak havoc in dynamic colosseums filled with traps and destructible scenery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions and politics: Align yourself with one of 4 powerful guilds, each with their own goals and storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared screen: Play with a friend and battle each other in arenas.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Choose your class vehicle, customize it with deadly weapons and conquer your place in the world. War of Wheels is a frenetic car fighting game in an original \u201cmedievalpunk\u201d setting. Ride your iron steed and become a legend.",
